calendar_date | Hari Raya Idul Adha                  | islamic_civil 12 10 | public religious |  |
calendar_date | Tahun Baru Islam                     | islamic_civil 1 1   | public religious |  |
calendar_date | Maulid Nabi Muhammad                 | islamic_civil 3 12  | public religious |  |
